    m_Localized: "Private room \xB7 password"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985459
    m_Localized: Tiles and the okey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985460
    m_Localized: 'There are 106 tiles: two of each number from 1 to 13 in red, yellow, blue and black, plus 2 false okeys.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985461
    m_Localized: The tile turned up in the middle is the indicator. The tile one above it is the okey and can stand in for any tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985462
    m_Localized: A false okey takes the place of the okey itself and has the okey's value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985463
    m_Localized: If the indicator is yellow 7, the okey is yellow 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985464
    m_Localized: Dealing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985465
    m_Localized: The tiles are shuffled and every player gets 21 tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985466
    m_Localized: The starting player gets 22 tiles and begins by discarding one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985467
    m_Localized: The remaining tiles form the draw pile in the middle. Play goes counter-clockwise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985468
    m_Localized: Opening your hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985469
    m_Localized: To open your hand, your sets must add up to at least 101.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985470
    m_Localized: 'Run: at least 3 consecutive tiles of the same color. Group: 3 or 4 tiles of the same number in different colors.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985471
    m_Localized: You can also open with at least 5 pairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985472
    m_Localized: Run 46 + group 36 = 82 points. You need 19 more to open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985473
    m_Localized: Adding tiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985474
    m_Localized: Once you have opened, you can add matching tiles to any set on the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985475
    m_Localized: If you hold the tile the okey stands for in a set on the table, you can swap it in and take the okey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985476
    m_Localized: You can add red 13 to the red run on the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985477
    m_Localized: Finishing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985478
    m_Localized: The player who places all their tiles in sets and discards their last tile finishes the hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985479
    m_Localized: If you finish by discarding the okey, every penalty is doubled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985480
    m_Localized: Discarding the okey as your last tile doubles all penalties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985481
    m_Localized: Scoring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985482
    m_Localized: The player who finishes gets -101 points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985483
    m_Localized: Players who opened get a penalty equal to the sum of the tiles left in their hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985484
    m_Localized: A player who never opened gets 202 penalty points. Players who opened with pairs get double penalties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985485
    m_Localized: The player with the lowest score at the end wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985486
